<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: light loitering munition -->
  <DMSE_MissileBody_Sabre.label>輕型巡飛彈</DMSE_MissileBody_Sabre.label>
  <!-- EN: A tube-launched loitering munition with folding wings and an image-recognition seeker. It is short-ranged and carries a small warhead, but it is light enough to fire from a shoulder launcher.\n\nIts seeker dives on the most dangerous enemy creature in the open. If it sees none, its loiter flight control holds it over the target area and keeps looking before it falls back to inertial guidance. Comes in a fixed configuration. -->
  <DMSE_MissileBody_Sabre.description>一種管射式折翼巡飛彈，配有圖像識別導引頭。射程短、彈頭小，但輕到能用肩射發射具發射。\n\n導引頭會俯衝攻擊屋頂外最危險的敵方生物；看不到目標時，盤旋飛控會讓它在目標區上空盤旋並持續搜索，時間用完才退回慣性導引。固定構型。</DMSE_MissileBody_Sabre.description>
  <!-- EN: Sabre -->
  <DMSE_MissileBody_Sabre.designWord>軍刀</DMSE_MissileBody_Sabre.designWord>
  
</LanguageData>